label Greeting
if {Transaction_GreetingVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Good day. I'm checking the local inventory for a specific instance.
else:
	Brahim: Hello. The environment variables in Karimlan are quite high today. I need to stabilize.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
if {Transaction_TalkVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: I'm requesting an instance of {Transaction_ItemWants}.
else:
	Brahim: My current process requires a {Transaction_ItemWants} to reach a stable state.
[end_timeline]

label Partial
Brahim: Validated. Next instance in the queue: {Transaction_ItemWants}.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_SatisfyVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: Transaction committed. The data is validated. Salamat.
else:
	Brahim: High throughput vibes detected. My internal build feels much more stable now.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
if {Transaction_WrongItemVar} <= 50:
	Brahim: A logical mismatch, I'm afraid. This item doesn't fit the current query.
else:
	Brahim: 404 Error. Object not found in this transaction. Let's try to re-re-sync.
[end_timeline]